sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SCH as APScheduler (crawl_tick)
    participant CR as Platform adapter
    participant ING as ingestion.ingest()
    participant NLP as ml/pipeline.enrich()
    participant GROQ as Groq verifier
    participant DB as SQLite / Postgres
    participant WS as WebSocket hub (/ws/live)
    participant UI as React dashboard

    SCH->>CR: collect(watch_terms)
    Note over CR: skipped unless this platform's<br/>min_interval_seconds has elapsed;<br/>bounded by timeout_seconds
    CR-->>SCH: list[RawPost] (never raises)
    SCH->>ING: ingest(raws)
    ING->>ING: content_hash dedupe
    ING->>NLP: enrich_batch()
    NLP->>NLP: language ID → context →<br/>3 models → ensemble →<br/>toxicity → concern score
    NLP-->>ING: label + score + evidence
    alt concern >= 55 and a key is set
        ING->>GROQ: second opinion (8 per tick)
        GROQ-->>ING: agree · dissent · override
    end
    ING->>ING: geo-tag from text, then translation
    ING->>DB: persist post + alerts
    DB->>DB: bands: >=60 critical, >=50 high, >=35 elevated
    ING->>WS: new posts + fired alerts
    WS-->>UI: live push (reconnecting socket)
    UI->>UI: feed, KPIs, map, network graph
